 past to their limits! Feel the adrenaline as you hit top speeds, execute daring jumps, and skillfully weave through traffic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across a variety of stunning landscapes, from the glittering streets of Neo Tokyo to glowing mountain passes, scorching deserts and distant otherworldly realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713530/extras/0f31517567032e41fe94db6ebced5923.poster.avif?t=1774123861\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713530/extras/0f31517567032e41fe94db6ebced5923.webm?t=1774123861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713530/extras/0f31517567032e41fe94db6ebced5923.mp4?t=1774123861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But why, father, why?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1\u00a0<strong>Drive Dozens of Supersport Cars</strong><br>Bring the 80s beasts back to the streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1\u00a0<strong>Explore Diverse Neon Environments</strong><br>Race through cityscapes, highways, tunnels, deserts, jungles, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1\u00a0<strong>High-Octane Synthwave Soundtrack</strong><br>Feel the synths of the 80s rumbling in your ears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1\u00a0<strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong><br>Time Trial, Checkpoint, Chase, Endless \u2013 just pick your poison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1\u00a0<strong>Compete on Global Leaderboards</strong><br>Prove you're worthy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1\u00a0<strong>Total 80s Immersion</strong><br>From visuals to music, dust off your VHS tape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragr